    "name": "Inconceivable Rat Endeavour",
    "steam_appid": 3338180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/65fadc3ff07392630f4aaaec2d37f8e1.avif?t=1755377531\" width=760 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are a rat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/69dbaa5bec2bd9ae32d6e13b613fef58.poster.avif?t=1755377531\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/69dbaa5bec2bd9ae32d6e13b613fef58.webm?t=1755377531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/69dbaa5bec2bd9ae32d6e13b613fef58.mp4?t=1755377531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smell trash, play with flies and eat cheese. Roleplay as the infamous <strong>generic rat</strong> and take on a huge journey through your home sewers with <strong>substantially wacky </strong>encounters, <strong>weird puzzles</strong> and <strong>extremely subtle, often unfunny jokes</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/6d69296b604baa039356602fc7de2e77.poster.avif?t=1755377531\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/6d69296b604baa039356602fc7de2e77.webm?t=1755377531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/6d69296b604baa039356602fc7de2e77.mp4?t=1755377531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have only one type of move - rotating the 6 hexes around the tile you click on. Use it to overcome a variety of challenges, avoid traps and slay your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Genre-bending</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/36e6addbeac8f847f4838881266f6143.poster.avif?t=1755377531\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/36e6addbeac8f847f4838881266f6143.webm?t=1755377531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/36e6addbeac8f847f4838881266f6143.mp4?t=1755377531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inconceivable Rat Endeavour</strong> is mainly a puzzle game. However, it borrows handsomely from other genres and sprinkles it on top of the core mechanics, achieving unique, unconventional and  <strong>silly</strong> gameplay. The game takes you on an <strong>endeavour</strong>, where you'll constantly see new things and travel forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/f022d8064c2a9b40f6a11dbcfb381d75.avif?t=1755377531\" width=760 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel the sewers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/65eed6cc8e8017057df4271369caa631.avif?t=1755377531\" data-has-big width=800 height=476 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit multiple sewer-stylized, pixelart biomes as you progress. Complete plethora of hand-crafted levels arranged into a linear campaign - a continuous adventure. Dive deeper into new mechanics with level branches that present harder challenges puzzle-wise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >at least one rat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >exactly 23 types of cheese</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >it's literally a game about a rat</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/65fadc3ff07392630f4aaaec2d37f8e1.avif?t=1755377531\" width=760 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are a rat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/69dbaa5bec2bd9ae32d6e13b613fef58.poster.avif?t=1755377531\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/69dbaa5bec2bd9ae32d6e13b613fef58.webm?t=1755377531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/69dbaa5bec2bd9ae32d6e13b613fef58.mp4?t=1755377531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smell trash, play with flies and eat cheese. Roleplay as the infamous <strong>generic rat</strong> and take on a huge journey through your home sewers with <strong>substantially wacky </strong>encounters, <strong>weird puzzles</strong> and <strong>extremely subtle, often unfunny jokes</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/6d69296b604baa039356602fc7de2e77.poster.avif?t=1755377531\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/6d69296b604baa039356602fc7de2e77.webm?t=1755377531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338180/extras/6d69296b604baa039356602fc7de2e77.mp4?t=1755377531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragr